---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import CTAFooter from "../components/CTAFooter.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Security — Vera AI"
  description="How Vera protects your code, credentials, and data. Tenant isolation, encrypted secrets, webhook verification, and zero-trust access controls."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="security">
    <div class="security-inner">
      <header class="security-header">
        <div class="security-badge">Security</div>
        <h1>Built with security as a first principle</h1>
        <p class="security-subtitle">
          Every tenant gets isolated infrastructure, encrypted credentials, and
          verified communications. Here's how we protect your code and data.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="callout">
        <h2>Your code is yours. We never train on it.</h2>
        <p>
          Your source code, prompts, and outputs are never used to train or
          fine-tune any model, and never used to improve our systems.
          Code context is sent to Anthropic's API for inference — Anthropic's
          API terms prohibit training on API inputs. No other third party
          receives your code. When a task is complete, code context is
          discarded from memory.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="security-grid">
        <section class="card">
          <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg>
          <h2>Tenant isolation</h2>
          <p>
            Each workspace runs on its own dedicated machine. There is no
            shared runtime between tenants — your code, credentials, and
            execution environment are completely isolated.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
          <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/><circle cx="12" cy="16.5" r="1.5"/></svg>
          <h2>Encrypted credentials</h2>
          <p>
            All OAuth tokens and API keys are encrypted at rest using
            AES-256-GCM before being stored. Secrets are injected into your
            dedicated machine at runtime and never written to disk unencrypted.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
          <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
          <h2>Webhook verification</h2>
          <p>
            Every inbound webhook from Linear and GitHub is verified with
            HMAC-SHA256 signatures using constant-time comparison. Requests
            with invalid or missing signatures are rejected immediately.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
          <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          <h2>OAuth CSRF protection</h2>
          <p>
            All OAuth flows use single-use, time-limited state tokens. Tokens
            expire after 10 minutes and are deleted on first use, preventing
            replay and cross-site request forgery attacks.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
          <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v2M12 21v2M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42M1 12h2M21 12h2M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42"/></svg>
          <h2>Zero-trust admin access</h2>
          <p>
            Administrative operations are protected by identity-provider
            authentication and application-level JWT verification. No admin
            endpoint is accessible without passing both layers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
          <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          <h2>Slack Socket Mode</h2>
          <p>
            Vera connects to Slack via Socket Mode — outbound WebSocket
            connections only. No inbound ports are exposed, reducing attack
            surface. Your Slack data never passes through a shared webhook
            endpoint.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <section class="key-storage">
        <h2>Key storage architecture</h2>
        <p class="key-storage-intro">
          Secrets pass through three layers, each with its own encryption and
          access controls. At no point are credentials stored in plaintext or
          exposed in logs or error messages.
        </p>

        <div class="arch-diagram" aria-label="Key storage architecture: three layers from encryption through secrets storage to isolated runtime">
          <div class="arch-box">
            <svg class="arch-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
            <div class="arch-label">Encryption layer</div>
            <div class="arch-desc">AES-256-GCM before storage</div>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-connector" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="connector-line"></div>
            <svg class="connector-arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M2 6h8M7 3l3 3-3 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-box">
            <svg class="arch-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
            <div class="arch-label">Secrets storage</div>
            <div class="arch-desc">Encrypted at rest, write-only</div>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-connector" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="connector-line"></div>
            <svg class="connector-arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M2 6h8M7 3l3 3-3 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-box">
            <svg class="arch-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="1"/></svg>
            <div class="arch-label">Isolated runtime</div>
            <div class="arch-desc">In-memory only, per tenant</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="principles">
        <h2>Our security principles</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>No shared secrets.</strong> Each tenant receives unique credentials.
            Compromise of one tenant's secrets does not affect others.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Secrets never in code.</strong> All sensitive values are stored as
            encrypted Worker secrets or encrypted database fields — never in
            source code, config files, or logs.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Minimal surface area.</strong> The router is stateless and
            intentionally minimal. It verifies, ACKs, and forwards — nothing
            else.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Defense in depth.</strong> Multiple independent layers protect every
            path: network-level policies, application-level JWT checks, per-tenant
            bearer tokens, and HMAC verification.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="data-residency">
        <h2>Data residency</h2>
        <p>All data is stored and processed in the <strong>United States</strong>.
          See our full <a href="/subprocessors" class="inline-link">subprocessors list</a> for details on every third-party service.</p>
        <div class="residency-grid">
          <div class="residency-item">
            <h3>Compute</h3>
            <p>Fly.io — US East</p>
          </div>
          <div class="residency-item">
            <h3>Database</h3>
            <p>Neon Postgres — US East</p>
          </div>
          <div class="residency-item">
            <h3>Object storage</h3>
            <p>Tigris — US East (iad)</p>
          </div>
          <div class="residency-item">
            <h3>Edge / KV</h3>
            <p>Cloudflare — global edge, US-origin</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact">
        <h2>Breach notification commitment</h2>
        <p>
          In the event of a confirmed security breach affecting your data, we
          will notify all impacted customers via email within 72 hours of
          discovery. Notifications will include the nature of the breach, what
          data was affected, the steps we are taking to remediate, and
          recommended actions on your end. We will provide ongoing updates
          until the incident is fully resolved.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="contact">
        <h2>Data retention and deletion</h2>
        <p>
          We retain tenant data only for as long as your account is active.
          OAuth tokens are overwritten on refresh and old values are not kept.
          When you uninstall Vera, your machine is destroyed and all associated
          credentials are deleted. You can request full data deletion at any
          time by emailing
          <a href="mailto:privacy@agent-army.ai">privacy@agent-army.ai</a>
          — we will complete the deletion within 30 days.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="contact">
        <h2>Report a vulnerability</h2>
        <p>
          If you've found a security issue, please email us at
          <a href="mailto:security@agent-army.ai">security@agent-army.ai</a>.
          We take all reports seriously and will respond within 48 hours.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <CTAFooter />
</Layout>

<style>
  .security {
    padding: 8rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .security-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .security-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .security-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.3);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .security-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .security-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .card {
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.12);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .card-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .card h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .key-storage {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .key-storage h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .key-storage-intro {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .arch-diagram {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .arch-box {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.15);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .arch-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .arch-label {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .arch-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .arch-connector {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 0.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .connector-line {
    width: 16px;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.2);
  }

  .connector-arrow {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    color: rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.3);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .principles {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .principles h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .principles ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .principles li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .principles li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.5em;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-text);
  }

  .principles li strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .callout {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border: 2px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.2);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .callout h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .callout p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .policy-link {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-link a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .inline-link {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .data-residency {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .data-residency h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .data-residency > p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .residency-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .residency-item {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.12);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .residency-item h3 {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .residency-item p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .contact {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.12);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .contact h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .contact p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .contact a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .security {
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    }

    .security-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .arch-diagram {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .arch-connector {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      padding: 0.25rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
